    comment "en" """
        Source M217X SNOMED CT 203601000 = unequal limb length, unspecified. Target SNOMED CT 40400785
        (203601000) = Acquired unequal leg length. Base ICD-10 M21.7 parent (45548352) crosswalks to
        45757656 (Acquired unequal limb length, 300261000119100), but 40400785 is the leg-specific
        equivalent which is more precise for the Swedish code that specifies (leg). Confidence :
        crosswalk-verified at the M21.7 parent level, but unspecified source and Swedish-extension code
        reduce from to.
        """
}
